        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1497_5389.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnßer</unclear> früntlich willig dienst, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> was wir
<lb n="2"/>ehren liebs und guots vermögend, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, from,
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtig, ersam, wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inßunders</unclear> guot fründt
<lb n="4"/>und getrüw lieb <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uff</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>dato sind abermalen als wir rhatswyße byein-
<lb n="6"/>andren versampt gweßen, vor uns erschinen
<lb n="7"/>unßre getrüwen lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtlüdt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Houptman</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><persName resp="#ner">Fridly <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heer</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> nechsten bluotsverwandten,
<lb n="9"/>unßers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußtrednen</unclear> landtmans <persName resp="#ner">Melchior Kouff-
<lb n="10"/>mans</persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehelichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußfrouwen</unclear>, und uns mit be-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">duren</unclear> fürtragen laßen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waßkhalt</unclear> er <persName resp="#ner">Kouffman</persName>
<lb n="12"/>syner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußfrouwen</unclear> nit allein all ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haab</unclear> und guot
<lb n="13"/>liederlich verbrucht, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sondren</unclear> vor etwas abgeloff-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ner</unclear> wochen flüchtigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuoß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesezt</unclear> sy und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kleine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unerzogne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kinden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">5</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhanden</unclear>,
<lb n="16"/>übergeben und verlaßen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dießelben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sündhalben</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uüßristen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bethl</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">armuot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geriche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wehrend</unclear>.
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sitmalen</unclear> aber die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frouw</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschlächts</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechste</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>baß, und leider zum theil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bnommen</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>und nit fehig, syend sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhabens</unclear> und bedacht
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dießelbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lebenlang</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebürende</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zimme</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfruondnen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> sy aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> solchem
<lb n="23"/>kein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßre</unclear> glegenheit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear> üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßren</unclear> getrüwen
<lb n="24"/>lieben <orgName resp="#ner">Eydtgnoßen</orgName> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spital</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzokomen</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßten</unclear>, verhoffend sy sovil gnad und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gunsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeuerlangen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> ir ermelte ire baß alß
<lb n="27"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">blinde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frouw</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">althers</unclear> in die 36 jar.
<lb n="28"/>umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfruondguolt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brüchig</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spital</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfruond</unclear> sy sich dann
<lb n="30"/>mit üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vereinbaren</unclear> möchten, weil wir bericht
<lb n="31"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dießelben</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezallung</unclear> deß pfruond gölts,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1497_5390.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/>auch in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spyß</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tranckh</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underscheid</unclear> sye
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzenemmen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstig</unclear> unbeschwert sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wurden</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> hiemit um ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Interceßion</unclear> schryben an
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getruewe</unclear> liebe <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zelaßen</unclear>,
<lb n="36"/>gantz underthenig angelangt, in hoffnung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßelb</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>woll und fruchtbarlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zegenießen</unclear>, und
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bermelte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtluet</unclear> in irem
<lb n="39"/>anbringen der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lenge</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernommen</unclear>, auch
<lb n="40"/>ghaltsame diser sachen im grund <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwegen</unclear>,
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuedem</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> deßen und alles anderen gueth-
<lb n="42"/>igen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydgnoeßischen</unclear> willens woll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getruewen</unclear>,
<lb n="43"/>haben wir diß ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pit</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverweygeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwußt</unclear>.
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Langt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derwegen</unclear> an dieselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruend</unclear>-
<lb n="45"/>lich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoeßischs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pit</unclear> und ansuechen, die
<lb n="46"/>wellen uns zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sondren</unclear> ehren und gfallen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">feer</unclear>-
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">than</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mzelten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> landt-
<lb n="48"/>lueten in obgedachtem irem vorhaben umb ein
<lb n="49"/>billich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfreundgelt</unclear> zewillfaren unbeschwert sein,
<lb n="50"/>soll als dann alles das ienig so in der ver-
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glychung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volgen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurdet</unclear>,
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffrecht</unclear>, redlich und woll gehalten und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstatet</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>werden, und uns by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißem</unclear>
<lb n="54"/>allein darumb abgesandten botten widerumb
<lb n="55"/>wißenhafft machen was ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierus</unclear>, auch
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiewie</unclear> sy von ein oder der anderen pfreundt
<lb n="57"/>erhalten mueßten, daran erwyßt
<lb n="58"/>ir nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werkh</unclear> der barmhertzigkeit,
<lb n="59"/>sondren auch uns und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwanten</unclear>
<lb n="60"/>ein hoches gefallen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welliches</unclear> wir
<lb n="61"/>gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> und allen den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwrigen</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuetragenden</unclear>
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fällen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeertwideren</unclear> und in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1497_5391.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="63"/>zuoerkhennen unvergäßen sÿn werden, Gott den
<lb n="64"/>allmechtigen, der ein rÿcher widergülter aller
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotaten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bittende</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿnem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vaett</unclear>-
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">langwiriger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsundtheit</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glückh</unclear>
<lb n="67"/>und fridlichem wolstand <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerhalten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="68"/><origDate when="1606-02-18" resp="#ner">den 18 februarij anno 1606</origDate>.
<lb n="69"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stathalter</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhatt</unclear>
<lb n="70"/>zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glarus</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1497_5392.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="71"/>Denn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>, er-
<lb n="72"/>samen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="73"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear> der statt Sant Gall-
<lb n="74"/>en</orgName> unßern insonders guoten
<lb n="75"/>fruenden und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getruewen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eydtgnoßen</unclear>.
</p>
